'''Baxcalibur''' (Japanese: '''セグレイブ''' ''Seglaive'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

