==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SVP Promo|Baxcalibur|19}}, one of the {{TCG|SVP Black Star Promos}}.
**Both cards have the '''Buster Tail''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Goodra|197}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

